{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31112","headline":"暇日寓怀寄朝中亲友 · 薛能","name":"暇日寓怀寄朝中亲友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"命与才违岂自由，我身何负我身愁。\n临生白发方监郡，遥耻青衣懒上楼。\n过客闷嫌疎妓乐，小儿憨爱□貔貅。\n闲吟一寄清朝侣，未必淮阴不拜侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}